  {
    "rid": "T000351",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_03_j",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000163:choice_short:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:9e8f2688cfcfe1da7ed14b0dd6d370003d72cd051348bbc24e2813349a832eab",
    "source": "享介さんは必ず戻ると\nわかっていたのかも",
    "before": "或许他早就知道\n享介一定会回来的",
    "after": "或许他早就知道\n享介先生一定会回来的",
    "reason": "R3.3 named さん as 先生"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000160",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_02_h",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:7927ba189c4bd3c00721f385196de7935e9c5996ed2430c62be9cd33f262a194",
    "source": "おっ、言うじゃねぇか。\n俺だって負けねぇぜ！",
    "before": "哟，口气倒挺大。\n本大爷也不会输的！",
    "after": "哟，口气倒挺大。\n我也不会输的！",
    "reason": "Voice: 冬馬 says 俺; 本大爷 is reserved for オレ様"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000716",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_06_d",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:29f18fa8044f48dc6219e8e81241688634faa494874a248228870b4c38369e71",
    "source": "あれ、姫野くんからLINKだ。\n何の用事だろう……。",
    "before": "哎，姫野君发LINK过来了。\n有什么事呢……。",
    "after": "哎，姬野君发LINK过来了。\n有什么事呢……。",
    "reason": "Project name spelling 姬野 (not Japanese 姫)"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000708",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_06_c",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_c:cmd-000109:dialogue:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:f1deda19d59572a72957c83e07f43d4609ac2497065862ba817e152f08970c81",
    "source": "……ふふ、そんなに違わなくていいんじゃないかな。\nC.FIRSTの中では、間違いなく最年少くんなんだし。",
    "before": "……呵呵，也不用这么强调差距吧。\n在C.FIRST里，你毫无疑问是最年少君呢。",
    "after": "……呵呵，也不用这么强调差距吧。\n在C.FIRST里，你毫无疑问是年纪最小的那个呢。",
    "reason": "Untranslated Japanese form 最年少くん"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000601",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_05_g",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:b7dd2e510b962f6dceda29c4c6795ecd0874f0ee6e6f2ab089a8e5cd3af45db0",
    "source": "あれが、見得を切るっていうんですね！",
    "before": "那个就叫定格亮相（Mie）对吧！",
    "after": "那个就叫“亮相”对吧！",
    "reason": "見得を切る is 亮相; no romanization"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000976",
    "document_id": "1_4_002_07_j",
    "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_4_002_07:1_4_002_07_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000",
    "source_hash": "sha256:319976842a4c4590aa0506b9b85b281040d4034d877ce6b865baeadd5c2fa3c2",
    "source": "己が持つ、才に溺れず努力せし。",
    "before": "怀才而不自傲，笃行而不辍步。",
    "after": "怀才在身，不溺于才，勤而不辍。",
    "reason": "想楽 senryu keeps its three-beat rhythm"
  },
  {
    "rid": "T000022",
